&lt;p&gt;A runner's list price per minute is not fully correlated with cost per job. Runners take different amounts of time and round differently. For example, GitHub rounds every job up to a whole minute, while Vitko Runners bills per second. So we measured the same twelve real open-source CI jobs on nine configurations and priced each run.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Cost per job against GitHub-hosted 2 vCPU, at 100,000 jobs a month: &lt;/p&gt;

