&lt;li&gt;Blacksmith 52% lower. &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A GitHub-hosted 4 vCPU runner cost 39% more per job and ran 1.6x as fast. &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-hosted options spread fixed monthly costs over the volume so their figure moves with it, the calculator shows that.&lt;/li&gt;
