  The plan
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Standard is free right now: "100,000 credits every 30 days - No end date set - No card required", and the page is explicit about "No automatic paid subscription. Existing paid subscriptions keep their terms." The Base64 tab runs on your device, so the credits are not what it is for anyway.&lt;/p&gt;

